王獨幸竇姬，生女嫖，後生兩男。而代王王后生四男。先代王未入立為帝而王后卒。及代王立為帝，而王后所生四男更病死。孝文帝立數月，公卿請立太子，而竇姬長男最長，立為太子。立竇姬為皇后，女嫖為長公主。其明年，立少子武為代王，已而又徙梁，是為梁孝王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"竇太后","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0013","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"呂太后","kind":"person","person_id":"trv_ybp_bes","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"竇姬","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"竇姬","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"竇姬","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"竇姬","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"代王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或待核稱謂；不由熟悉生平補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0133","start":133,"end":135,"surface":"竇姬","kind":"person","person_id":"ixk_6fg_v6f_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0138","start":138,"end":139,"surface":"嫖","kind":"person","person_id":"lfn_6kn_o3b_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"兩男","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名者或待核稱謂；不由熟悉生平補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0146","start":146,"end":150,"surface":"代王王后","kind":"person","person_id":"yvu_kzd_gnn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m012-0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"四男","kind":"unresolved","person_